        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Hydrogen cyanide from Sohio process, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Hydrogen cyanide from Sohio process, at plant
The multioutput-process "Sohio process" delivers the co-products acrylonitrile, hydrigen cyanide, and acetoinitrile. The allocation is based on mass balance.;
UUID: eb38f85d-d438-32de-a269-de02d1139033
Sohio process including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Sohio process
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports and emissions are modelled with standard methods.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_eb38f85d-d438-32de-a269-de02d1139033.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
